msgid "Display Detail Level:"
msgstr "Onyesha Kiwango cha Maelezo:"
msgid "This determines the amount of detail displayed in the output.\n\nLevel 0 = the least detail, 5 = the most detail."
msgstr "Hii huamua kiasi cha maelezo yanayoonyeshwa katika matokeo.\n\nKiwango cha 0 = maelezo madogo zaidi, 5 = maelezo zaidi."
