msgid "The 'Profiles Per Line' setting is used to control the number of Profiles to be displayed per line when diagramming the configuration.\n\nThe smaller the number, the narrower the diagram and vice versa.\n\nFewer Profiles per line may make it easier too view the diagram connectors that extend to the right, while at the same time the Diagram wil be longer.\n\nSelecting a number will automatically re-generate the diagram with the new setting.\n\nThis setting is only valid for the currrent Diagram view, and will be reset back to the default value when the Diagram view is closed.\n\n"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya 'Wasifu Kwa Kila Mstari' hutumika kudhibiti idadi ya Wasifu zitakazoonyeshwa kwa kila mstari wakati wa kuweka mipangilio katika mchoro.\n\nKadiri nambari inavyopungua, ndivyo mchoro unavyopungua na kinyume chake.\n\nWasifu wachache kwa kila mstari unaweza kurahisisha kuangalia viunganishi vya mchoro vinavyoenea kulia, na wakati huo huo nambari ya kuchagua Mchoro itakuwa ndefu zaidi. itaunda upya mchoro kiotomatiki kwa mpangilio mpya.\n\nMpangilio huu ni halali kwa mwonekano wa sasa wa Mchoro pekee, na utarejeshwa kwa thamani chaguomsingi mwonekano wa Mchoro utakapofungwa.\n\n"
msgid "The 'Search' button will search for and highlight every instance of the string entered in the search box, starting at the top of the data.\n\nThe 'Search Here' button will search for and highlight every instance of the string entered in the search box, starting at the current screen.\n\nHover over any of the highlighted matching strings to see all matches.\n\nThe 'Next' and 'Prev' buttons will try to make the next and previous occurrence of the search string visible in the text view box, and highlight them in a different color.\n\nThe accuracy of making the search string visible is not always perfect and is out of the control of the this program.\n\nWhen the end or beginning of the text view box is reached, the search will stop and a message will be displayed for several seconds.\n\nThe 'Clear' button will clear the search results.\n\nThe 'Display Only' button will display in a miscellaneous window ONLY the matches from the search results.\n\n"
msgstr "Kitufe cha 'Tafuta' kitatafuta na kuangazia kila tukio la mfuatano uliowekwa kwenye kisanduku cha kutafutia, kuanzia sehemu ya juu ya data.\n\nKitufe cha 'Tafuta Hapa' kitatafuta na kuangazia kila tukio la mfuatano uliowekwa kwenye kisanduku cha kutafutia, kuanzia kwenye skrini ya sasa.\n\nElea juu ya mfuatano wowote ulioangaziwa ili kuona mechi zote.\n\nKitufe cha 'Prevt' kitajaribu 'Prevt' kifuatacho. na utokeaji wa awali wa mfuatano wa utafutaji unaoonekana katika kisanduku cha kutazama maandishi, na uangazie kwa rangi tofauti.\n\nUsahihi wa kufanya mfuatano wa utafutaji uonekane si kamilifu kila wakati na uko nje ya udhibiti wa programu hii.\n\nWakati mwisho au mwanzo wa kisanduku cha kutazama maandishi umefikiwa, utafutaji utaacha na ujumbe utaonyeshwa kwa sekunde kadhaa.\n\nKitufe cha utafutaji kitafuta 'Futa'. matokeo.\n\nKitufe cha 'Onyesha Pekee' kitaonyeshwa katika dirisha la aina mbalimbali TU zinazolingana kutoka kwa matokeo ya utafutaji.\n\n"

