msgid "This is a list of all of the fonts available on your system, monospaced ones first and marked as such.\n\nThe font selected will be used in all output.\n\n'Courier' or 'Courier New' is highly recommended for Diagrams to ensure proper connector alignment. A font that is not monospaced will not hold the Diagram's connectors or the output's indentation in line."
msgstr "Hii ni orodha ya fonti zote zinazopatikana kwenye mfumo wako, zile zenye nafasi moja kwanza na kuwekewa alama hivyo.\n\nFonti iliyochaguliwa itatumika katika matokeo yote.\n\n'Courier' au 'Courier New' inapendekezwa sana kwa Michoro ili kuhakikisha upatanishi sahihi wa kiunganishi. Fonti ambayo haina nafasi moja haitashikilia viunganishi vya Mchoro au ujongezaji wa matokeo kwenye mstari."

msgid "This will save the Task directly into Tasker running on the Android device running the Tasker server.\n\nThe IP Address and Port must match the Android device's Tasker server settings.\n\nYou will be prompted twice for authorization to write to Tasker on the Android device, and the Task.and its own actions will determine where it is saved on the device."
msgstr "Hii itahifadhi Jukumu moja kwa moja kwenye Tasker inayoendeshwa kwenye kifaa cha Android kinachoendesha seva ya Tasker.\n\nAnwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio ya seva ya Tasker ya kifaa cha Android.\n\nUtaombwa mara mbili kwa uidhinishaji wa kumwandikia Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android, na Task.na matendo yake yenyewe ndiyo yatakayobainisha mahali inapohifadhiwa kwenye kifaa."

msgid "This will save the Task directly into the active Tasker session on your Android device.\n\nTasker version 6.2 or greater is required for this to work.The Android device must be on the same network, and the IP Address and Port\nmust match the Android device's Tasker server settings.\n\nYou will be prompted twice for authorization to write to Tasker on the Android device, and the Task will be loaded directly into the active Tasker session.\n\nYou must exit and restart Tasker to see the new Task in the Tasker UI."
msgstr "Hii itahifadhi Jukumu moja kwa moja kwenye kipindi cha Tasker kinachotumika kwenye kifaa chako cha Android.\n\nToleo la Tasker 6.2 au zaidi inahitajika ili hii ifanye kazi.Kifaa cha Android lazima kiwe kwenye mtandao sawa, na Anwani ya IP na Lango.\nlazima ilingane na mipangilio ya seva ya Tasker ya kifaa cha Android.\n\nUtaombwa mara mbili kwa idhini ya kumwandikia Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android, na Jukumu litapakiwa moja kwa moja kwenye kipindi kinachotumika cha Tasker.\n\nNi lazima uondoke na uanze upya Tasker ili kuona Jukumu jipya katika Kiolesura cha Tasklor."

msgid "This will save the Task directly to your current drive.\n\n"
msgstr "Hii itahifadhi Task moja kwa moja kwenye hifadhi yako ya sasa.\n\n"

msgid "This will write the Profile as a standalone file onto the Android device, under /Tasker/profiles.\n\nThe IP Address and Port must match the Android device's Tasker server settings.\n\nNo authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Wasifu kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/profiles.\n\nAnwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio ya seva ya Tasker ya kifaa cha Android.\n\nHakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

msgid "This will write the Profile as a standalone file onto your Android device, under /Tasker/profiles -- it does not import it into Tasker's live configuration.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project (http://spoo.me/http_svr_example) must be installed and active on the Android device, with the server running (see the README's Direct XML Retrieval notes).\n\nThe Android device must be on the same network, and the IP Address and Port must match its Tasker server settings. No authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Wasifu kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa chako cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/profiles -- haiingizii kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker.\n\nMradi wa Tasker wa 'Http Server Example' (http://spoo.me/http_svr_example) lazima usakinishwe na kufanya kazi kwenye kifaa cha Android, seva inayoendesha (angalia madokezo ya README ya Direct XML ya Urejeshaji).\n\nKifaa cha Android lazima kiwe kwenye mtandao sawa, na Anwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio yake ya seva ya Tasker. Hakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

msgid "This will write the Profile as a standalone file onto your Android device, under /Tasker/profiles -- it does not import it into Tasker's live configuration.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and active on the Android device, with the server running (see the README's Direct XML Retrieval notes).\n\nThe Android device must be on the same network, and the IP Address and Port must match its Tasker server settings. No authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Wasifu kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa chako cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/profiles -- haiingizii kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker.\n\nMradi wa Tasker wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na kufanya kazi kwenye kifaa cha Android, seva inayoendesha (angalia madokezo ya README ya Direct XML Retrieval).\n\nKifaa cha Android lazima kiwe kwenye mtandao sawa, na Anwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio yake ya seva ya Tasker. Hakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

msgid "This will write the Project, and everything in it -- every Profile and Task -- as a standalone file onto your Android device, under /Tasker/projects -- it does not import it into Tasker's live configuration.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and active on the Android device, with the server running.\n\nThe Android device must be on the same network, and the IP Address and Port must match its Tasker server settings. No authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Mradi, na kila kitu ndani yake -- kila Wasifu na Kazi -- kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa chako cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/projects -- haiingizii kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker.\n\nMradi wa Tasker wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na kufanya kazi kwenye kifaa cha Android, huku seva ikiendesha.\n\nKifaa cha Android lazima kiwe kwenye mtandao sawa, na Anwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio yake ya seva ya Tasker. Hakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

msgid "This will write the Project, and everything in it, as a standalone file onto the Android device, under /Tasker/projects.\n\nThe IP Address and Port must match the Android device's Tasker server settings.\n\nNo authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Mradi, na kila kitu ndani yake, kama faili ya pekee kwenye kifaa cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/projects.\n\nAnwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio ya seva ya Tasker ya kifaa cha Android.\n\nHakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

