msgstr "Geuza Funga"

msgid "Unlink"
msgstr "Tenganisha"

msgid "Value"
msgstr "Thamani"

msgid "View cleared."
msgstr "Mwonekano umefutwa."

msgid "Week-Day"
msgstr "Wiki-Siku"

msgid "When enabled, clicking 'Exit' also closes the main MapTasker window and any Map/Diagram windows/tabs it opened.\n\nWhen disabled, 'Exit' shuts down MapTasker but leaves those windows/tabs open."
msgstr "Inapowashwa, kubofya 'Ondoka' pia hufunga dirisha kuu la MapTasker na madirisha/vichupo vyovyote vya Ramani/Mchoro ulichofungua.\n\nInapozimwa, 'Toka' huzima MapTasker lakini huacha madirisha/vichupo hivyo wazi."

msgid "When enabled, each Map/Diagram request opens in its own new window/tab, so you can keep earlier ones up alongside it to compare.\n\nWhen disabled, a request reuses that view's existing window/tab, replacing what's in it.\n\nLeave it off unless you want to compare: a brand new window/tab is the one your browser may block, since it gets opened once the view has finished building rather than the instant you click."
msgstr "Inapowashwa, kila ombi la Ramani/Mchoro hufunguka katika dirisha/kichupo chake kipya, ili uweze kuweka za awali kando yake ili kulinganisha.\n\nInapozimwa, ombi hutumia tena dirisha/tabo iliyopo ya mwonekano huo, na kuchukua nafasi ya kilichomo.\n\nIache isipokuwa ungependa kulinganisha: dirisha/tabo mpya kabisa ndiyo ambayo kivinjari chako kinaweza kuzuia, kwa kuwa inafunguliwa mara tu mwonekano unapomaliza kujenga badala ya kubofya mara moja."

msgid "hh:mm AM/PM or %variable"
msgstr "hh:mm AM/PM au %kigeugeu"

msgid "MapTasker: view limit reached, stopping output to file:  output"
msgstr "Error 500 (Server Error)!!1500.That’s an error.There was an error. Please try again later.That’s all we know."

msgid "hardstop view limit"
msgstr "kikomo cha kutazama cha hardstop"

msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "(tupu)"

msgid "(no name)"
msgstr "(hakuna jina)"

msgid "(unnamed)"
msgstr "(bila jina)"

msgid "(unnamed Task)"
msgstr "(Kazi isiyo na jina)"

msgid "-1 means this orientation has no layout of its own."
msgstr "-1 inamaanisha mwelekeo huu hauna mpangilio wake."

msgid "...and {count} more -- type above to narrow it down."
msgstr "...na {count} zaidi -- andika juu ili kuipunguza."

msgid "A Scene's element positions are stored in device pixels, but its text sizes are stored in Android's sp units. The number that converts between the two is a property of the phone the Scene is shown on, and is not in the backup file.\n\nSo it is set here. Raise it if the text looks too small for its elements, lower it if the text overflows them."
msgstr "Nafasi za vipengee vya Scene huhifadhiwa katika pikseli za kifaa, lakini saizi zake za maandishi huhifadhiwa katika vitengo vya sp vya Android. Nambari inayobadilisha kati ya hizi mbili ni sifa ya simu ambayo Onyesho linaonyeshwa, na haiko kwenye faili ya chelezo.\n\nKwa hivyo imewekwa hapa. Inua ikiwa maandishi yanaonekana kuwa madogo sana kwa vipengele vyake, yapunguze ikiwa maandishi yamefurika."

msgid "A Version 2 Scene has no size of its own -- it lays itself out inside whatever screen it is shown on, so there is nothing in the backup file to draw it at.\n\nChange this to see the layout re-flow. A Flow Row wraps differently, and any 'Show when' written against %sv2_render_width is asking about exactly this."
msgstr "Onyesho la Toleo la 2 halina ukubwa wake -- linajiweka ndani ya skrini yoyote linaonyeshwa, kwa hivyo hakuna chochote katika faili chelezo cha kuichora.\n\nBadilisha hii ili kuona mtiririko wa mpangilio. Safu Mlalo ya Mtiririko inasongwa tofauti, na 'Onyesha wakati' yoyote iliyoandikwa dhidi ya %sv2_render_width inauliza kuhusu hili haswa."

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Vitendo"

