msgid "Adds an element on top of the stack, in the middle of the Scene."
msgstr "Huongeza kipengele juu ya rafu, katikati ya Onyesho."

msgid "Adds inside the selected component if it can hold children, otherwise directly after it."
msgstr "Huongeza ndani ya kijenzi kilichochaguliwa ikiwa kinaweza kushikilia watoto, vinginevyo moja kwa moja baada yake."

msgid "Also selected:"
msgstr "Imechaguliwa pia:"

msgid "Adds it on top of the stack, in the middle of the Scene. Drag it where you want it."
msgstr "Huiongeza juu ya rundo, katikati ya Onyesho. Iburute unapotaka."

msgid "Also update"
msgstr "Pia sasisha"

msgid "App icon"
msgstr "Aikoni ya programu"

msgid "Amber: Tasker lists it, but MapTasker has no confirmed sample of it. Grey: can't go where the selection would put it."
msgstr "Amber: Tasker inaiorodhesha, lakini MapTasker haina sampuli yake iliyothibitishwa. Grey: haiwezi kwenda ambapo uteuzi ungeiweka."

msgid "Appearance Mode"
msgstr "Hali ya Kuonekana"

msgid "Applied in order — the one at the bottom sits on top."
msgstr "Imetumika kwa mpangilio - ile iliyo chini inakaa juu."

msgid "Applied when this Scene is saved, not now -- Cancel on the Scene dialog leaves both the element and the Tasks exactly as they were."
msgstr "Inatumika wakati Onyesho hili limehifadhiwa, sio sasa -- Ghairi kwenye kidirisha cha Onyesho huacha kipengele na Majukumu kama yalivyokuwa."

msgid "Back to Editor"
msgstr "Rudi kwa Mhariri"

msgid "Bounds"
msgstr "Mipaka"

msgid "Cancelled. Changes to this Scene were discarded."
msgstr "Imeghairiwa. Mabadiliko kwenye Onyesho hili yametupwa."

msgid "Choose another file..."
msgstr "Chagua faili nyingine..."

msgid "Click a component to select it, shift-click another in the same container to take several, and drag to reorder them among their own siblings. Moving a component into or out of a container is the editor's In and Out buttons; Undo is there too."
msgstr "Bofya kijenzi ili kukichagua, bofya kitufe cha shift-click kwenye chombo kimoja ili kuchukua kadhaa, na uburute ili kuzipanga upya kati ya ndugu zao wenyewe. Kuhamisha kijenzi ndani au nje ya kontena ni vitufe vya kihariri vya Kuingia na Kutoka; Tendua ipo pia."

msgid "Click an element to select it, drag to move, drag a handle to resize, arrow keys to nudge (Shift for 10px). Shift-click, or drag a box on the background, to take several at once."
msgstr "Bofya kipengee ili kukichagua, buruta ili kusogeza, buruta mpini ili kubadilisha ukubwa, vitufe vya vishale ili kugusa (Shift kwa 10px). Bofya Shift, au buruta kisanduku kwenye usuli, kuchukua kadhaa mara moja."

msgid "Click an element to select it, Shift-click or drag a box on the background to take several, and drag any of them to move them all -- arrow keys nudge, Shift for 10px. Drag a handle to resize a single element. Undo, and everything else about an element, is back in the editor."
msgstr "Bofya kipengee ili kukichagua, Shift-click au buruta kisanduku kwenye usuli kuchukua kadhaa, na buruta yoyote kati ya hizo ili kuzisogeza zote -- gusa vitufe vya vishale, Shift kwa 10px. Buruta mpini ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa kipengele kimoja. Tendua, na kila kitu kingine kuhusu kipengele, kimerudishwa kwenye kihariri."

msgid "Closes without saving, and puts this Scene back exactly as it was when this dialog opened -- including anything moved or resized in the Preview.\n\nA Rename is the one thing this cannot take back: it is applied to the loaded backup as it is confirmed, and closes this dialog with it."
msgstr "Hufunga bila kuhifadhi, na hurudisha Onyesho hili nyuma jinsi ilivyokuwa wakati kidirisha hiki kilipofunguliwa -- ikijumuisha kitu chochote kilichohamishwa au kubadilishwa ukubwa katika Onyesho la Kuchungulia.\n\nKubadilisha jina ni jambo moja ambalo haliwezi kurudisha nyuma: linatumika kwa chelezo iliyopakiwa inapothibitishwa, na kufunga mazungumzo haya nayo."

msgid "Compare Files"
msgstr "Linganisha Faili"

msgid "Compare With"
msgstr "Linganisha Na"

msgid "Compare another XML file against the loaded one: what was added, removed, renamed and changed.\n\nUse it to see what a TaskerNet import brought in, what an edit changed, or what is different between two backups.\n\nIf the loaded file came from 'Save to Current File', the file it was saved from is offered directly.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the current directory."
msgstr "Linganisha faili nyingine ya XML dhidi ya iliyopakiwa: kilichoongezwa, kuondolewa, kubadilishwa jina na kubadilishwa.\n\nItumie kuona uletaji wa TaskerNet ulileta nini, ni hariri gani iliyobadilika, au ni tofauti gani kati ya nakala mbili.\n\nIkiwa faili iliyopakiwa ilitoka kwa 'Hifadhi kwa Faili ya Sasa', faili ambayo ilihifadhiwa kutoka hutolewa moja kwa moja.\n\nMatokeo yanaonyeshwa hapa na kuhifadhiwa kwa faili ya maandishi katika saraka ya sasa."

msgid "Comparison cancelled."
msgstr "Ulinganisho umeghairiwa."

msgid "Comparison report could not be saved."
msgstr "Ripoti ya kulinganisha haikuweza kuhifadhiwa."

msgid "Comparison saved as"
msgstr "Ulinganisho umehifadhiwa kama"

msgid "Delete Scene"
msgstr "Futa Onyesho"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "Imekamilika"

msgid "Drawn in"
msgstr "Imetolewa ndani"

msgid "Draws this Scene as a picture in the main window -- including the components you have added or changed here but not yet saved.\n\nA Version 2 layout has no size of its own, so the preview lays it out in a screen you pick, and re-flows it when you change that.\n\nThis dialog closes while the preview is up, with everything in it kept; the preview's 'Back to Editor' button brings it back.\n\nIt is a representation, not Tasker's own renderer: %variables are named rather than resolved, Material colours come from the baseline palette rather than the device's theme, and images, video and web content are shown as placeholders."
msgstr "Huchora Onyesho hili kama picha katika dirisha kuu -- ikijumuisha vipengele ulivyoongeza au kubadilisha hapa lakini bado havijahifadhiwa.\n\nMpangilio wa Toleo la 2 hauna ukubwa wake, kwa hivyo onyesho la kukagua huiweka kwenye skrini unayochagua, na huutiririsha upya unapobadilisha.\n\nKidirisha hiki hufunga wakati onyesho la kuchungulia likiwa juu, na kila kitu kilichomo kikihifadhiwa; kitufe cha 'Rudi kwa Kihariri' cha onyesho la kuchungulia huirejesha.\n\nNi kiwakilishi, si kionyeshi cha Tasker mwenyewe: vigeu %vinaitwa badala ya kutatuliwa, rangi za nyenzo hutoka kwenye ubao wa msingi badala ya mandhari ya kifaa, na picha, video na maudhui ya wavuti huonyeshwa kama vishikilia nafasi."

msgid "Draws this Scene as a picture in the main window, at the size typed above -- including changes not yet saved.\n\nThis dialog closes while the preview is up, with everything in it kept; the preview's 'Back to Editor' button brings it back.\n\nIt is a representation, not Tasker's own renderer: %variables are named rather than resolved, and images, video and web content are shown as placeholders."
msgstr "Huchora Onyesho hili kama picha katika dirisha kuu, kwa ukubwa ulioandikwa hapo juu -- ikijumuisha mabadiliko ambayo bado hayajahifadhiwa.\n\nKidirisha hiki hufunga wakati onyesho la kuchungulia likiwa juu, na kila kitu kilichomo kikihifadhiwa; kitufe cha 'Rudi kwa Kihariri' cha onyesho la kuchungulia huirejesha.\n\nNi kiwakilishi, si kionyeshi cha Tasker mwenyewe: vigeu %vinaitwa badala ya kutatuliwa, na picha, video na maudhui ya wavuti huonyeshwa kama vishikilia nafasi."

msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "Nakala"

msgid "Dropdown menu — shown when opened"
msgstr "Menyu kunjuzi - huonyeshwa wakati inafunguliwa"

msgid "Dynamic and Select Variable are worked out when the Scene is shown."
msgstr "Kibadilishi chenye Nguvu na Chagua hufanyiwa kazi wakati Onyesho linaonyeshwa."

msgid "Dynamic value"
msgstr "Thamani inayobadilika"

msgid "Edit Scene"
msgstr "Hariri Onyesho"

msgid "Edit item layout"
msgstr "Badilisha mpangilio wa kipengee"

msgid "Edit this one's properties instead, keeping the selection."
msgstr "Hariri sifa za huyu badala yake, ukiweka chaguo."

msgid "Event handlers"
msgstr "Washughulikiaji wa hafla"

msgid "Export Scene"
msgstr "Hamisha Onyesho"

msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Jiometri"

msgid "Grey: MapTasker has no argument table for it, so it can't be created without guessing what Tasker expects inside. Headings are MapTasker's own grouping."
msgstr "Grey: MapTasker haina jedwali la hoja kwayo, kwa hivyo haiwezi kuundwa bila kubahatisha Tasker anatarajia nini ndani. Vichwa ni kambi ya MapTasker yenyewe."

msgid "Hatched fills and italic underlined text are %variables -- their values live on the device, not in the backup, so they are named rather than guessed at. Images, video, maps and web content are shown as placeholders. Hover any element for its geometry, its variables and the Tasks it runs."
msgstr "Vijazo vilivyotolewa na maandishi yaliyopigiwa mstari kwa italiki ni %vigeu -- thamani zake huishi kwenye kifaa, si katika hifadhi rudufu, kwa hivyo zimepewa majina badala ya kubashiriwa. Picha, video, ramani na maudhui ya wavuti huonyeshwa kama vishikilia nafasi. Elea kipengee chochote kwa jiometri yake, vijiti vyake na Kazi inayoendesha."

msgid "Health Check"
msgstr "Uchunguzi wa Afya"

msgid "Health Check report could not be saved."
msgstr "Ripoti ya Ukaguzi wa Afya haikuweza kuhifadhiwa."

msgid "Health Check found no errors or warnings."
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa Afya haukupata hitilafu au maonyo."

msgid "Health Check saved as"
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa Afya umehifadhiwa kama"

msgid "How long a pop-up message stays on screen before it disappears.\n\n'Until dismissed' keeps every message up until you close it, which is useful when a message scrolls past before you can read it.\n\nA few messages set their own longer duration because they list things you have to read -- the Tasks affected by deleting or renaming a Scene element, for instance. Those keep their own timing whatever is chosen here."
msgstr "Muda gani ujumbe ibukizi hukaa kwenye skrini kabla haujatoweka.\n\n'Mpaka kuondolewa' huweka kila ujumbe hadi uufunge, ambayo ni muhimu wakati ujumbe unasonga mbele kabla ya kuusoma.\n\nBarua pepe chache huweka muda wao mrefu zaidi kwa sababu huorodhesha vitu ambavyo unapaswa kusoma -- Majukumu yanayoathiriwa na kufuta au kubadilisha jina la kipengele cha Onyesho, kwa mfano. Wale huweka muda wao wenyewe chochote kinachochaguliwa hapa."

msgid "In the list: Shift-click for a range, Ctrl- or Cmd-click to add or remove one."
msgstr "Katika orodha: Shift-click kwa masafa, Ctrl- au Cmd-click ili kuongeza au kuondoa moja."

msgid "Item layout"
msgstr "Mpangilio wa kipengee"

msgid "Landscape"
msgstr "Mazingira"

msgid "Legacy"
msgstr "Urithi"

msgid "Legacy Scene"
msgstr "Tukio la Urithi"

msgid "List"
msgstr "Orodha"

msgid "MapTasker: view limit reached, diagram truncated"
msgstr "MapTasker: kikomo cha kutazama kimefikiwa, mchoro umepunguzwa"

msgid "Modifiers"
msgstr "Virekebishaji"

msgid "Never updated"
msgstr "Haijasasishwa kamwe"

msgid "No Task addresses this element by name."
msgstr "Hakuna Jukumu linaloshughulikia kipengele hiki kwa jina."

msgid "No XML file has been loaded.  Get an XML file first."
msgstr "Hakuna faili ya XML iliyopakiwa.  Pata faili ya XML kwanza."

msgid "No element matches that."
msgstr "Hakuna kipengele kinacholingana na hicho."

msgid "Not an HTML colour name or #hex value."
msgstr "Sio jina la rangi ya HTML au thamani ya #hex."

msgid "Not updated -- these name both this Scene and this element, but not as a"
msgstr "Haijasasishwa -- hizi hutaja Onyesho hili na kipengele hiki, lakini si kama a"

msgid "Nothing here."
msgstr "Hakuna kitu hapa."

