msgstr "Wakati tu"

msgid "Outline every component and name it, the way the designer's tree names it."
msgstr "Eleza kila kijenzi na ukipe jina, jinsi mti wa mbunifu unavyokitaja."

msgid "Outline every element and name it."
msgstr "Eleza kila kipengele na ukipe jina."

msgid "Pick a Material icon."
msgstr "Chagua aikoni ya Nyenzo."

msgid "Pick an icon"
msgstr "Chagua ikoni"

msgid "Pick from the Scene's environment and global variables."
msgstr "Chagua kutoka kwa mazingira ya Onyesho na anuwai za ulimwengu."

msgid "Pick one of Material's own colour roles."
msgstr "Chagua mojawapo ya majukumu ya rangi ya Nyenzo."

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Hakiki"

msgid "Project(s) that list it."
msgstr "Miradi inayoorodhesha."

msgid "Prompts for a new name and applies it to the loaded backup, right now -- renaming the Scene everywhere, including in the Scene list of every Project that holds it.\n\nTasks that show or hide this Scene by name are NOT updated; those still name the old Scene.\n\nThe Scene Name field above is read-only -- this is the only way to change it."
msgstr "Inaomba jina jipya na kulitumia kwenye hifadhi rudufu iliyopakiwa, sasa hivi -- ikibadilisha jina la Onyesho kila mahali, ikijumuisha katika orodha ya Maonyesho ya kila Mradi ulio nayo.\n\nMajukumu yanayoonyesha au kuficha Onyesho hili kwa jina HAYAISASISHA; hao bado wanataja Scene ya zamani.\n\nSehemu ya Jina la Onyesho hapo juu ni ya kusoma tu -- hii ndiyo njia pekee ya kuibadilisha."

msgid "Properties"
msgstr "Mali"

msgid "Properties are edited one element at a time. Dragging and nudging move everything selected."
msgstr "Sifa huhaririwa kipengele kimoja kwa wakati mmoja. Kuburuta na kusogeza kila kitu kilichochaguliwa."

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Onyesha upya"

msgid "Remove background"
msgstr "Ondoa usuli"

msgid "Rename Element"
msgstr "Badilisha Kipengele Kipengele"

msgid "Renaming an element in here does not sweep the backup: an item layout has no Scene name for a Task's Element action to address it by, so there is nothing to rewrite."
msgstr "Kubadilisha jina la kipengee hapa hakufagii nakala rudufu: mpangilio wa kipengee hauna jina la Onyesho kwa ajili ya kitendo cha Kipengele cha Task kushughulikia, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kuandika upya."

msgid "Repeats once per array entry"
msgstr "Hurudiwa mara moja kwa kila safu ya ingizo"

msgid "Round dragged positions and sizes to this many pixels."
msgstr "Nafasi na saizi zilizoburutwa pande zote hadi pikseli nyingi hivi."

msgid "Save Scene To Android Device"
msgstr "Hifadhi Onyesho kwa Kifaa cha Android"

msgid "Saves the entire backup -- every Project, Profile, Task and Scene in it, not just this Scene -- including every edit made anywhere in this session.\nIt is written to a new, timestamped copy of the file currently loaded: backup.xml becomes backup_20260728_143005.xml.\nThe file you loaded is never written to, so it is left exactly as it was.\nThe app then switches to the new copy, which becomes the current file for any further editing and saving; saving again replaces the timestamp rather than adding a second one.\nThis writes to this computer only -- nothing is sent to your Android device."
msgstr "Huhifadhi chelezo nzima -- kila Mradi, Wasifu, Jukumu na Mandhari ndani yake, si Tukio hili -- ikijumuisha kila hariri iliyofanywa popote katika kipindi hiki.\nImeandikwa kwa nakala mpya, iliyopigwa muhuri wa muda ya faili iliyopakiwa kwa sasa: backup.xml inakuwa backup_20260728_143005.xml.\nFaili uliyopakia haijaandikiwa kamwe, kwa hivyo inaachwa kama ilivyokuwa.\nProgramu kisha inabadilisha hadi nakala mpya, ambayo inakuwa faili ya sasa kwa uhariri na uhifadhi wowote zaidi; kuokoa tena kunabadilisha muhuri wa wakati badala ya kuongeza ya pili.\nHii inaandikia kompyuta hii pekee -- hakuna kitu kinachotumwa kwa kifaa chako cha Android."

msgid "Saves this Scene, with all of its elements, as one standalone .scn.xml file -- the same format Tasker's own Scene export produces.\n\nTasks the Scene's elements run are not included; they belong to their own Project."
msgstr "Huhifadhi Onyesho hili, pamoja na vipengele vyake vyote, kama faili moja inayojitegemea ya .scn.xml -- umbizo sawa na Uhamishaji wa Tasker mwenyewe wa Scene.\n\nKazi zinazoendeshwa na vipengele vya Onyesho hazijajumuishwa; wao ni wa Mradi wao wenyewe."

msgid "Scan the loaded XML for broken references, unreferenced Tasks, Profiles and Scenes, and naming problems.\n\nResults are displayed here and saved to a text file in the current directory."
msgstr "Changanua XML iliyopakiwa kwa marejeleo yaliyovunjika, Majukumu ambayo hayajarejelewa, Wasifu na Matukio, na matatizo ya kutaja.\n\nMatokeo yanaonyeshwa hapa na kuhifadhiwa kwa faili ya maandishi katika saraka ya sasa."

