msgid "Tasker keeps this Task inside the Scene and nowhere else, so it has no name and cannot be pointed somewhere else without losing it. It is carried through untouched."
msgstr "Tasker huweka Jukumu hili ndani ya Onyesho na hakuna mahali pengine popote, kwa hivyo halina jina na haliwezi kuelekezwa mahali pengine bila kulipoteza. Inapitishwa bila kuguswa."

msgid "Tasker lists this element, but MapTasker has never seen one in a saved Scene -- so it is added carrying nothing but its type and id, and even the type is inferred from the name above (written as type: \"{node_type}\"). If Tasker doesn't recognise it, press Undo."
msgstr "Tasker inaorodhesha kipengele hiki, lakini MapTasker haijawahi kuona moja katika Onyesho lililohifadhiwa -- kwa hivyo imeongezwa ikiwa haina chochote ila aina yake na kitambulisho, na hata aina hiyo imeainishwa kutoka kwa jina lililo hapo juu (limeandikwa kama aina: \"{node_type}\"). Ikiwa Tasker haitambui, bonyeza Tendua."

msgid "Tasker variable(s)"
msgstr "Tofauti za mtekelezaji"

msgid "Tasker's Screen Builder: a declarative component tree (Column, Row, Scaffold, ...) that lays itself out, with no fixed canvas size. Start from:"
msgstr "Kijenzi cha Skrini cha Tasker: mti wa kijenzi tangazo (Safu, Safu, Kiunzi, ...) unaojiweka nje, bila saizi isiyobadilika ya turubai. Anza kutoka:"

msgid "Tasks address this element by name (Element Text, Element Position, ... 18 action codes in all), so renaming it is not a field edit. The Rename dialog lists what depends on the current name and offers to bring those Tasks along."
msgstr "Majukumu yanashughulikia kipengele hiki kwa jina (Maandishi ya Kipengele, Nafasi ya Kipengele, ... misimbo 18 ya kitendo kwa jumla), kwa hivyo kukipa jina upya si hariri ya sehemu. Kidirisha cha Badilisha Jina huorodhesha kinachotegemea jina la sasa na matoleo ya kuleta Majukumu hayo pamoja."

msgid "Text density"
msgstr "Uzito wa maandishi"

msgid "Tasks that show or hide this Scene by name are not changed, and are left where they are."
msgstr "Kazi zinazoonyesha au kuficha Onyesho hili kwa jina hazibadilishwi, na huachwa pale zilipo."

msgid "That component can't go there."
msgstr "Sehemu hiyo haiwezi kwenda huko."

