msgstr "Orodha ya aikoni ya Nyenzo haikuweza kusomeka, kwa hivyo andika jina badala yake."

msgid "The Tasker variable this component writes its value into. Separate several with commas. Leave empty to declare the binding without setting it."
msgstr "Tofauti ya Tasker kipengele hiki huandika thamani yake ndani. Tenganisha kadhaa kwa koma. Acha tupu ili kutangaza kufunga bila kuiweka."

msgid "The Tasks that address it will be updated when this Scene is saved."
msgstr "Majukumu yanayoishughulikia yatasasishwa Tukio hili litakapohifadhiwa."

msgid "The loaded file was saved from"
msgstr "Faili iliyopakiwa ilihifadhiwa kutoka"

msgid "The layout of one row. Tasker draws it once per entry of whatever fills the list, so what you see here is a single row rather than the list."
msgstr "Mpangilio wa safu moja. Tasker huchora mara moja kwa kila ingizo la chochote kinachojaza orodha, kwa hivyo unachoona hapa ni safu mlalo moja badala ya orodha."

msgid "The original"
msgstr "Ya asili"

msgid "The original Scene: UI elements placed at fixed positions on a sized canvas (Text, Button, Rect, Image, Web, ...)."
msgstr "Onyesho Asili: Vipengele vya UI vilivyowekwa katika nafasi zisizobadilika kwenye turubai ya ukubwa (Maandishi, Kitufe, Rect, Picha, Wavuti, ...)."

msgid "The screen size is this preview's, not the Scene's -- a Version 2 layout has no size of its own, so change 'Screen' to see it re-flow. Colours named by Material role are drawn from the Material 3 baseline palette; the device resolves them against its own theme, which under Material You comes from the wallpaper. Hatched fills and italic underlined text are %variables. Amber outlines mark components with a 'Show when'. Hover any component for its modifiers, variables and actions."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa skrini ni wa onyesho hili la kuchungulia, si la Onyesho -- mpangilio wa Toleo la 2 hauna ukubwa wake, kwa hivyo badilisha 'Skrini' ili kuona inatiririka tena. Rangi zilizotajwa kwa jukumu la Nyenzo zimechorwa kutoka kwa ubao wa msingi wa Nyenzo 3; kifaa huyasuluhisha dhidi ya mada yake yenyewe, ambayo chini ya Nyenzo Unayotoka kwenye mandhari. Vijazo vilivyotolewa na maandishi ya italiki yaliyopigiwa mstari ni %vigeu. Amber inaangazia vipengele kwa 'Onyesha lini'. Elea kipengee chochote kwa virekebishaji, vigeu na vitendo vyake."

msgid "The search did not finish. The view may be too large, or the browser is busy."
msgstr "Utafutaji haukuisha. Mwonekano unaweza kuwa mkubwa sana, au kivinjari kina shughuli nyingi."

msgid "The two files hold the same configuration."
msgstr "Faili hizi mbili zina usanidi sawa."

