msgstr "Onyesho hili halina vipengele vya UI."

msgid "This Scene has no properties element. 66 of the 366 Scenes MapTasker has seen have none either, so this is ordinary rather than damage."
msgstr "Onyesho hili halina kipengele cha sifa. 66 kati ya 366 Scenes MapTasker haijaona pia, kwa hivyo hii ni kawaida badala ya uharibifu."

msgid "This Scene's Version 2 layout could not be read, and will be left exactly as it is."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu wa Toleo la 2 la Scene haukuweza kusomeka, na utaachwa jinsi ulivyo."

msgid "This Scene's Version 2 layout has no root component, so there is nothing to design."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu wa Toleo la 2 la Scene hauna sehemu ya mizizi, kwa hivyo hakuna kitu cha kubuni."

msgid "This app has no property table for this element type, so only its geometry can be edited here. It is otherwise carried through untouched."
msgstr "Programu hii haina jedwali la sifa kwa aina hii ya kipengele, kwa hivyo jiometri yake pekee ndiyo inayoweza kuhaririwa hapa. Vinginevyo hupitishwa bila kuguswa."

msgid "This element has no layout for this orientation."
msgstr "Kipengele hiki hakina mpangilio wa mwelekeo huu."

msgid "This will write the Scene as a standalone file onto the Android device, under /Tasker/scenes.\n\nThe IP Address and Port must match the Android device's Tasker server settings.\n\nNo authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Onyesho kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/scenes.\n\nAnwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio ya seva ya Tasker ya kifaa cha Android.\n\nHakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

msgid "This will write the Scene as a standalone file onto your Android device, under /Tasker/scenes -- it does not import it into Tasker's live configuration.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and active on the Android device, with the server running.\n\nThe Android device must be on the same network, and the IP Address and Port must match its Tasker server settings. No authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itaandika Onyesho kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa chako cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/scenes -- haiingizii kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker.\n\nMradi wa Tasker wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na kufanya kazi kwenye kifaa cha Android, huku seva ikiendesha.\n\nKifaa cha Android lazima kiwe kwenye mtandao sawa, na Anwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio yake ya seva ya Tasker. Hakuna kidokezo cha idhini kinachohitajika kwa hili."

