msgid "'Find...' asks the loaded configuration a question rather than searching the text on screen: every Task performing a given action, every Profile a given trigger fires, everything that names a given app or Scene.\n\nThe boxes combine -- pick a trigger and an action to find the Profiles that trigger that way and run a Task that does that.\n\nResults come back as a list of objects; click one to be taken to it.\n\n"
msgstr "'Tafuta...' inauliza usanidi uliopakiwa swali badala ya kutafuta maandishi kwenye skrini: kila Jukumu linalotekeleza kitendo fulani, kila Wasifu kwa kichochezi fulani, kila kitu kinachotaja programu au Onyesho fulani.\n\nSanduku huchanganyika -- chagua kichochezi na kitendo cha kutafuta Wasifu ambao huanzisha hivyo na kutekeleza Jukumu linalofanya hivyo.\n\nMatokeo yanarudi kama orodha ya vitu; bonyeza moja kupelekwa kwake.\n\n"

