msgid "...replace this argument"
msgstr "...badilisha hoja hii"

msgid "Action argument"
msgstr "Mzozo"

msgid "Add it where missing"
msgstr "Ongeza kwenye sehemu ambayo inakoswa"

msgid "Choose an action, and which of its arguments to replace."
msgstr "Chagua kitendo, na ni hoja zipi za kubadilisha."

msgid "Display with a monospaced font (e.g. Courier New) for accurate column alignment. And turn off line wrap.\nIcons or Chinese/Korean/Japanese in names can cause minor mis-alignment."
msgstr "Onyesha kwa fonti iliyo na nafasi moja (k.m. Courier New) kwa upangaji sahihi wa safu wima. Na kuzima safu ya mstari.\nAikoni au Kichina/Kikorea/Kijapani katika majina inaweza kusababisha upangaji mbaya mdogo."

msgid "Drawn for"
msgstr "Imechorwa kwa"

msgid "Error: Single item specified but not found!  Try again."
msgstr "Hatiliko: Bidhaa moja ilielekezwa, lakini haikuupatikana! Jaribu tena."

msgid "In this action"
msgstr "Katika hatua hii"

msgid "Nothing in scope has that argument to change."
msgstr "Hakuna chochote katika upeo kina hoja hiyo ya kubadilika."

msgid "Only the matching text"
msgstr "Maandishi yanayolingana pekee"

msgid "Only where the value contains (optional)"
msgstr "Tu katika mahali ambapo thamani ina (wa chaguo)"

msgid "Press Diagram View to rebuild it."
msgstr "Bonyeza Mwonekano wa Mchoro ili uijenge upya."

msgid "Rebuild"
msgstr "Ujenaji upya"

msgid "The change is applied.  Press Map View to see it."
msgstr "Mabadiliko imekamilika. Bonyeza \"Maoni ya Ramani\" ili kuona."

msgid "now showing"
msgstr "sasa zinazozikiwa"

msgid "the whole configuration"
msgstr "mseto zote"

msgid "'Find/Replace' asks the loaded configuration a question rather than searching the text on screen: every Task performing a given action, every Profile a given trigger fires, everything that names a given app or Scene.\n\nThe boxes combine -- pick a trigger and an action to find the Profiles that trigger that way and run a Task that does that.\n\nResults come back as a list of objects; click one to be taken to it.\n\n"
msgstr "'Tafuta/Badilisha' inauliza swali kwa usanidi uliopangwa, badala ya kutafuta kwenye maandishi kwenye skrini: kila kazi inayofanya hatua fulani, kila profaili inayotumia jambo fulani, kila kitu kinachoitwa programu au eneo fulani.\n\nVyombo hufanywa pamoja – chagua jambo linalotumika na hatua ili kupata profaili zinazotumia jambo hilo, na kuanzisha kazi inayofanya hivyo.\n\nMatokeo huwasilishwa kama orodha ya vitendo; bonyeza moja ili kupitia.\n\n"

msgid "Choose a Profile condition to replace, and one to replace it with."
msgstr "Chagua hali ambayo utaondoa, na hali nyingine ambayo utaweka mahali yake."

msgid "Find/Replace"
msgstr "Tafuta/Badilisha"

msgid "Profile condition"
msgstr "Hali"

msgid "Replace this Profile condition"
msgstr "Badilisha hali hii"

msgid "%variable_name"
msgstr "%jina_ya_mabadiliko"

msgid "A variable name has to start with '%' -- for example %app_package."
msgstr "Jina la msingi lazima kuanze na '%' – kwa mfano, %app_package."

msgid "Also in this field"
msgstr "Pia katika eneo hili"

msgid "App not listed?"
msgstr "Funguo haipatikani?"

msgid "Choose from the Applications named in the loaded configuration."
msgstr "Chagua kutoka kwenye programu zinazotajwa katika usanidi uliopangwa."

msgid "Choose from the icons used in the loaded configuration."
msgstr "Chagua kutoka kwa ikoni zilizotumika katika usanidi uliopangwa."

msgid "Fetch"
msgstr "Pata"

msgid "Fetch Applications From Android Device"
msgstr "Pata Maombi kutoka kwa Diski ya Android"

msgid "Fetch the full list of installed applications from your Android device.  What is listed now is only what this configuration already names."
msgstr "Pata orodha kamili ya programu zilizochapishwa kutoka kwenye kifaa chako cha Android. Hiyo ambayo imejadiliwa sasa ni tu programu ambazo tayari zimeainishwa."

msgid "Fetching..."
msgstr "Inaleta..."

msgid "Fill all three fields in from the loaded configuration."
msgstr "Jaza zana zote tatu kwa taarifa kutoka kwa usanidi uliopangwa."

msgid "Import Into Tasker"
msgstr "Uaguzi kwa Tasker"

msgid "Listing the XML files on the Android device..."
msgstr "Inaorodhesha faili za XML kwenye kifaa cha Android..."

msgid "More matches than can be shown -- narrow the search."
msgstr "Matokeo zaidi kuliko vinavyoonekana – pandua utafutaji."

msgid "No Icon"
msgstr "Hakuna ikoni"

msgid "Or a Tasker variable:"
msgstr "Au tofauti ya Tasker:"

msgid "Pick"
msgstr "Chagua"

msgid "Pick an Application"
msgstr "Chagua Programu"

msgid "Save As File"
msgstr "Hifadhi kama faili"

msgid "The Applications named somewhere in the loaded configuration -- or name a Tasker variable, which fills the Package and Label fields with it and leaves the Class empty, the way Tasker writes one."
msgstr "Programu zilizoitwa katika eneo fulani la usanidi – au, nipe jina la variable ya Tasker, ambayo inaambatana na maeneo ya \"Package\" na \"Label\" na kuacha \"Class\" kosong, kama ilivyo katika Tasker."

msgid "The Applications named somewhere in the loaded configuration.  Tick every one this argument should match.  Anything already in the field that isn't listed stays."
msgstr "Programu zilizopewa jina mahali fulani katika usanidi uliopakiwa.  Weka alama kwa kila hoja hii inapaswa kuendana.  Chochote ambacho tayari kiko kwenye uwanja ambacho hakijaorodheshwa hukaa."

msgid "The icons used somewhere in the loaded configuration.  What you pick replaces what the field holds.  An icon from an icon pack that isn't listed has to be typed: its names live inside the pack."
msgstr "Aikoni zinazotumika mahali fulani katika usanidi uliopakiwa.  Unachochagua huchukua nafasi ya kile shamba inachoshikilia.  Aikoni kutoka kwa pakiti ya aikoni ambayo haijaorodheshwa lazima ichapwe: majina yake yanapatikana ndani ya kifurushi."

msgid "This puts the Profile in front of Tasker's own import screen on the Android device.  You then tap Import on the device to finish -- nothing is imported until you do.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inaweka Wasifu mbele ya skrini ya kuingiza ya Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Kisha utagonga Leta kwenye kifaa ili umalize -- hakuna kitakacholetwa hadi ufanye.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This puts the Project -- and every Profile and Task in it -- in front of Tasker's own import screen on the Android device.  You then tap Import on the device to finish; nothing is imported until you do.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inaweka Mradi -- na kila Wasifu na Jukumu ndani yake -- mbele ya skrini ya kuingiza ya Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Kisha ugonge Leta kwenye kifaa ili kumaliza; hakuna kitu kinachoingizwa hadi ufanye.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This sends the Scene -- and every Task its elements fire -- to the Android device under its own name, into /Tasker/scenes, and opens Tasker.\n\nYou finish it on the device with Tasker's 'Scenes > Import One Scene', and pick the Scene by name.  Unlike a Profile or a Project, a Scene cannot be put in front of Tasker's import screen from here -- Tasker will not take one handed to it, though it imports the very same file when you pick it.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii hutuma Onyesho -- na kila Kazi vipengele vyake viwaka moto -- kwa kifaa cha Android chini ya jina lake, kwenye /Tasker/scenes, na kufungua Tasker.\n\nUnaimaliza kwenye kifaa kwa kutumia 'Scenes> Leta One' ya Tasker, na uchague Onyesho kwa jina.  Tofauti na Wasifu au Mradi, Onyesho haliwezi kuwekwa mbele ya skrini ya kuingiza ya Tasker kutoka hapa -- Tasker haitachukua mkono mmoja kwake, ingawa inaleta faili sawa wakati unapoichagua.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "Use Selected"
msgstr "Tumia Iliyochaguliwa"

msgid "Waiting on the Android device -- accept the authorization prompt there if one appears.  This can take 30 seconds or more."
msgstr "Kusubiri kwenye kifaa cha Android -- kubali ombi la uidhinishaji hapo iwapo litatokea.  Hii inaweza kuchukua sekunde 30 au zaidi."

msgid "Watch your Android device: Tasker will ask you to authorize the connection, and the fetch cannot go on until you accept.  Allow 30 seconds or more once you have -- longer on a device with several hundred applications, since each one's name is looked up individually."
msgstr "Tazama kifaa chako cha Android: Tasker itakuuliza uidhinishe muunganisho, na uchotaji hauwezi kuendelea hadi ukubali.  Ruhusu sekunde 30 au zaidi ukishapata -- tena kwenye kifaa kilicho na programu mia kadhaa, kwa kuwa jina la kila moja hutafutwa kivyake."

msgid "applications, fetched"
msgstr "maombi, yaliyoletwa"

msgid "This opens a choice of two: write the Task as a standalone file onto your Android device under /Tasker/tasks, or import it straight into Tasker's live configuration.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and active on the Android device, with the server running (see the README's Direct XML Retrieval notes), and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe Android device must be on the same network, and the IP Address and Port must match its Tasker server settings.\n\nThe file write needs no authorization prompt; the import asks for one, and you must exit and restart Tasker to see an imported Task in the Tasker UI."
msgstr "Hii itafungua chaguo kati ya mbili: andika Task kama faili inayojitegemea kwenye kifaa chako cha Android chini ya /Tasker/tasks, au iingize moja kwa moja kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker.\n\nMradi wa Tasker wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na kufanya kazi kwenye kifaa cha Android, seva inayoendesha (angalia madokezo ya README ya Direct XML Retrieval), na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa cha Android lazima kiwe kwenye mtandao sawa, na Anwani ya IP na Lango lazima zilingane na mipangilio yake ya seva ya Tasker.\n\nUandishi wa faili hauhitaji uidhinishaji wa haraka; uagizaji unauliza moja, na lazima utoke na uanze upya Tasker ili kuona Jukumu lililoingizwa kwenye Kiolesura cha Tasklor."

msgid "This puts the Profile in front of Tasker's own import screen on the Android device.  You then tap Import on the device to finish -- nothing is imported until you do.\n\nThe Profile is copied to /Tasker/profiles under its own name first and offered from there, so it stays behind under a name you can find -- import it by hand from Tasker if the import screen does not come up.  You will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inaweka Wasifu mbele ya skrini ya kuingiza ya Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Kisha utagonga Leta kwenye kifaa ili umalize -- hakuna kitakacholetwa hadi ufanye.\n\nProfaili imenakiliwa kwa /Tasker/profiles chini ya jina lake kwanza na kutolewa kutoka hapo, kwa hivyo inabaki nyuma chini ya jina unaloweza kupata -- iingize kwa mkono kutoka kwa Tasker ikiwa skrini ya kuingiza haitokei.  Utaulizwa kabla ya kuchukua nafasi ya faili tayari kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This puts the Project -- and every Profile and Task in it -- in front of Tasker's own import screen on the Android device.  You then tap Import on the device to finish; nothing is imported until you do.\n\nThe Project is copied to /Tasker/projects under its own name first and offered from there, so it stays behind under a name you can find -- import it by hand from Tasker if the import screen does not come up.  You will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inaweka Mradi -- na kila Wasifu na Jukumu ndani yake -- mbele ya skrini ya kuingiza ya Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Kisha ugonge Leta kwenye kifaa ili kumaliza; hakuna kitu kinachoingizwa hadi ufanye.\n\nMradi huo unakiliwa kwa /Tasker/projects chini ya jina lake kwanza na kutolewa kutoka hapo, kwa hivyo unabaki nyuma chini ya jina unaloweza kupata -- liingize kwa mkono kutoka kwa Tasker ikiwa skrini ya kuingiza haitokei.  Utaulizwa kabla ya kuchukua nafasi ya faili tayari kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This puts the Task straight into Tasker's live configuration on the Android device.  Unlike a Profile, a Project or a Scene, no import screen and no tap on the device are needed -- Tasker's api/import takes a Task directly.\n\nThe Task is copied to /Tasker/tasks on the device first and imported from there, so the copy stays behind as a record of exactly what was imported.  You will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inaweka Task moja kwa moja kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Tofauti na Wasifu, Mradi au Onyesho, hakuna skrini ya kuleta na hakuna mguso kwenye kifaa unaohitajika -- api/kuagiza ya Tasker huchukua Jukumu moja kwa moja.\n\nJukumu linanakiliwa kwa /Tasker/tasks kwenye kifaa kwanza na kuingizwa kutoka hapo, kwa hivyo nakala inasalia nyuma kama rekodi ya kile hasa kilicholetwa.  Utaulizwa kabla ya kuchukua nafasi ya faili tayari kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This sends the Scene -- and every Task its elements fire -- to the Android device under its own name, into /Tasker/scenes, and opens Tasker.\n\nYou finish it on the device with Tasker's 'Scenes > Import One Scene', and pick the Scene by name.  Unlike a Profile or a Project, a Scene cannot be put in front of Tasker's import screen from here -- Tasker will not take one handed to it, though it imports the very same file when you pick it.\n\nYou will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii hupeleka \"Scène\" – na kila \"Task\" na vipengele vyake – kwenye kifaa cha Android kwa jina lake, katika /Tasker/scenes, na inaanzisha Tasker.\n\nUnaweza kukamilisha hili kwenye kifaa kwa kutumia \"Scène > Import One Scene\" katika Tasker, na kuchagua \"Scène\" kwa jina. Mbali na \"Profile\" au \"Project\", \"Scène\" haiwezi kuwekwa kwenye skrini ya kuagiza ya Tasker – hata kama Tasker huchukua faili sawa wakati unaichagua.\n\nUtachungulwa kabla ya kuagiza faili ambayo tayari iko kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nMradi \"Http Server Example\" wa Tasker lazima iwekwe na itafanya kazi, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitaomba idhini ya MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This will write the Task as a standalone file onto the Android device, under /Tasker/tasks.\n\nThe IP Address and Port must match the Android device's Tasker server settings.\n\nNo authorization prompt is needed for this."
msgstr "Hii itatoa kazi kama faili moja kwenye kifaa cha Android, chini ya /Tasker/tasks.\n\nAnwani ya IP na kiwango lazima zalingana na mipangilio ya seva ya Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.\n\nHakuna mahitaji ya kuomba idhini kwa hii."

msgid "Delete them from Tasker's Tasks tab -- long-press one, then Delete.  Nothing here can do it: Tasker's HTTP API has no way to delete a Task."
msgstr "Futa zana hizo kutoka kwenye tab \"Mada\" kwenye Tasker – bonyeza mara kadhaa, kisha \"Futa\". Hakuna kitu hapa ambacho kinaweza kufanya hivyo: API ya HTTP ya Tasker, haipatii njia ya kufuta \"Mada\"."

msgid "In use -- leave these alone:"
msgstr "- Katika matumizi: Usiguse hizi"

msgid "List Helper Tasks"
msgstr "Orodha za Kazi"

msgid "Lists the 'MapTasker ...' Tasks this program has installed on the Android device, and says which are left over from an earlier version.\n\nEach one is installed under a versioned name and never replaced -- Tasker's import adds a second Task rather than replacing the first -- so old ones stay behind in your Task list.  They do no harm; they are clutter.\n\nDelete the ones it names from Tasker's own Tasks tab.  Nothing here can do it for you: Tasker's HTTP API has no way to delete a Task."
msgstr "Huorodhesha 'MapTasker ...' Kazi ambazo programu hii imesakinisha kwenye kifaa cha Android, na inasema zipi zimesalia kutoka kwa toleo la awali.\n\nKila moja imesakinishwa chini ya jina lililotolewa na haijawahi kubadilishwa -- Uingizaji wa Tasker huongeza Jukumu la pili badala ya kuchukua nafasi ya la kwanza -- ili zile za zamani zibaki nyuma katika orodha yako ya Kazi.  Hawadhuru; wao ni vituko.\n\nFuta zile inazozitaja kwenye kichupo cha Majukumu cha Tasker.  Hakuna chochote hapa kinachoweza kukusaidia: API ya HTTP ya Tasker haina njia ya kufuta Task."

msgid "MapTasker Helper Tasks"
msgstr "Masuala muhimu kwa MapTasker"

msgid "Nothing left over -- every MapTasker Task on the device is in use."
msgstr "Hakuna kilichosalia -- kila Kazi ya MapTasker kwenye kifaa inatumika."

msgid "This copies the Profile to the device and opens Android's 'Open with...' chooser for it.  Pick Tasker, and its own import screen comes up; you then tap Import to finish -- nothing is imported until you do.\n\nThe Profile is copied to /Tasker/profiles under its own name first and offered from there, so it stays behind under a name you can find -- import it by hand from Tasker if the import screen does not come up.  You will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inakili Wasifu kwenye kifaa na kufungua kichaguzi cha Android cha 'Fungua kwa...' kwa ajili yake.  Chagua Tasker, na skrini yake ya kuingiza inakuja; kisha ugonge Ingiza ili umalize -- hakuna kinacholetwa hadi ufanye.\n\nProfaili imenakiliwa kwa /Tasker/profiles chini ya jina lake kwanza na kutolewa kutoka hapo, kwa hivyo inabaki nyuma chini ya jina unaloweza kupata -- iingize kwa mkono kutoka kwa Tasker ikiwa skrini ya kuingiza haitokei.  Utaulizwa kabla ya kuchukua nafasi ya faili tayari kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This copies the Project -- and every Profile and Task in it -- to the device and opens Android's 'Open with...' chooser for it.  Pick Tasker, and its own import screen comes up; you then tap Import to finish, and nothing is imported until you do.\n\nThe Project is copied to /Tasker/projects under its own name first and offered from there, so it stays behind under a name you can find -- import it by hand from Tasker if the import screen does not come up.  You will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inakili Mradi -- na kila Wasifu na Kazi ndani yake -- kwa kifaa na kufungua kichaguzi cha Android cha 'Fungua kwa...' kwa ajili yake.  Chagua Tasker, na skrini yake ya kuingiza inakuja; kisha ugonge Ingiza ili kumaliza, na hakuna kitu kinacholetwa hadi ufanye.\n\nMradi huo unakiliwa kwa /Tasker/projects chini ya jina lake kwanza na kutolewa kutoka hapo, kwa hivyo unabaki nyuma chini ya jina unaloweza kupata -- liingize kwa mkono kutoka kwa Tasker ikiwa skrini ya kuingiza haitokei.  Utaulizwa kabla ya kuchukua nafasi ya faili tayari kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This puts the Task straight into Tasker's live configuration on the Android device.  Unlike a Profile, a Project or a Scene, no import screen and no tap on the device are needed -- Tasker's api/import takes a Task directly.\n\nThe Task is copied to /Tasker/tasks on the device first and imported from there, so the copy stays behind as a record of exactly what was imported.  You will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nIf Tasker does not report the Task after two attempts, that copy is handed to Android's 'Open with...' chooser instead, so you can import it by picking Tasker.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii inaweka Task moja kwa moja kwenye usanidi wa moja kwa moja wa Tasker kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Tofauti na Wasifu, Mradi au Onyesho, hakuna skrini ya kuleta na hakuna mguso kwenye kifaa unaohitajika -- api/kuagiza ya Tasker huchukua Jukumu moja kwa moja.\n\nJukumu linanakiliwa kwa /Tasker/tasks kwenye kifaa kwanza na kuingizwa kutoka hapo, kwa hivyo nakala inasalia nyuma kama rekodi ya kile hasa kilicholetwa.  Utaulizwa kabla ya kuchukua nafasi ya faili tayari kwenye njia hiyo.\n\nIkiwa Tasker haitaripoti Jukumu baada ya majaribio mawili, nakala hiyo itakabidhiwa kwa kiteuzi cha Android cha 'Fungua kwa...', ili uweze kuiingiza kwa kuchagua Tasker.\n\nMradi wa 'Http Server Example' lazima usakinishwe na uendeshwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitakuomba uidhinishe MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "This sends the Scene -- and every Task its elements fire -- to the Android device under its own name, into /Tasker/scenes, and opens Android's 'Open with...' chooser for it.\n\nIf Tasker is in that chooser, pick it.  A Scene is the one kind Tasker has been seen to refuse when it is handed one, so if it is not there -- or nothing happens -- finish it with Tasker's 'Scenes > Import One Scene' and pick the Scene by name.  The file is on the device either way, and the message tells you its name.\n\nYou will be asked before it replaces a file already at that path.\n\nThe 'Http Server Example' Tasker Project must be installed and running, and Tasker must be 6.2 or higher.\n\nThe device will ask you to authorize MapTasker the first time."
msgstr "Hii hupeleka \"Scene\" – na kila \"Task\" na vipengele vyake – kwenye kifaa cha Android kwa jina lake, katika /Tasker/scenes, na hufungua \"Open with...\" cha Android kwa ajili yake.\n\nIkiwa Tasker iko kwenye \"Open with...\", uchague. \"Scene\" ni aina moja ambayo Tasker inaonekana kuwa inapuuza inapopokea, kwa hivyo ikiwa si hivyo – au hakuna kitu – fanya hivyo kwa kutumia \"Scenes > Import One Scene\" ya Tasker na uchague \"Scene\" kwa jina. Faili hiyo iko kwenye kifaa, na ujumla unaeleza jina lake.\n\nUtatolewa swali kabla ya faili hiyo kubadilishwa.\n\nMradi wa \"Http Server Example\" wa Tasker lazima uwekwe na ufungiwe, na Tasker lazima iwe 6.2 au zaidi.\n\nKifaa kitauliza uweke ruhusa MapTasker mara ya kwanza."

msgid "left over from an earlier version -- safe to delete in Tasker:"
msgstr "iliyoachwa kutoka kwa toleo la awali -- salama kufuta katika Tasker:"

msgid "Clear the field, leaving the action with no icon."
msgstr "Fanya hivyo, na uondoe tatizo, bila kuacha alama."

msgid "Clicking this will launch 'pip install --upgrade maptasker' in the background, and then relaunch MapTasker."
msgstr "Bonyeza hii, na itawatoa 'pip install --upgrade maptasker' kwenye nafasi, na kisha itawatoa MapTasker tena."

msgid "Display the changes in the new version."
msgstr "onyesha mabadiliko katika toleo mpya."

msgid "Enables the display a breakdown of the Tasker system Preferences in the output."
msgstr "Inabeba kuonyesha maelezo kuhusu mipangilio ya mfumo wa Tasker kwenye matokeo."

msgid "Enables the display of Conditions, TaskerNet Info, Preferences, the Directory, and Prettier Output."
msgstr "Inabeba maonyesho ya Masharti, Maelezo ya TaskerNet, Vipendwa, Dira, na Matokeo za Kufanya Vizuri."

msgid "Enables the display of Profile Conditions (e.g. State, Event, etc.) details in the output."
msgstr "Inabeba maelezo ya Masharti ya Profaili (kwa mfano, Hali, Matukio, n.k.) katika matokeo."

msgid "Enables the display of TaskerNet Descriptions in the output."
msgstr "Inabeba maelezo ya TaskerNet katika matokeo."

msgid "Enables the display of aligned text in the output."
msgstr "Inaboresha kuonyesha maandishi iliyoelezwa katika matokeo."

msgid "Enables the display of the Project/Profile/Task/Scene Directory in the output."
msgstr "Inabeba uwezo wa kuonyesha orodha ya Mradi/Profaili/Kazi/Mazingira katika matokeo."

msgid "Fetch the full list of installed Applications from the Android device."
msgstr "Pata orodha kamili ya programu zilizosakinishwa kwenye kifaa cha Android."

msgid "Pick a Task which will be called by this action."
msgstr "Chagua kazi ambayo itafanywa na hatua hii."

msgid "Saves this Profile as a standalone .prf.xml file on this computer."
msgstr "Hifadhi profaili hii kama faili .prf.xml inayoweza kufungua kwa moja kwenye kompyuta hii."

msgid "Select the model belonging to the AI you wish to use."
msgstr "Chagua mfumo unaobora, ambao unataka kutumia."

msgid "This will reach out to your Android device to list the available XML files belonging to Tasker."
msgstr "Hii itawasiliana na kifaa chako cha Android ili kuorodha faili za XML zinazohusika na programu ya Tasker."

msgid "When enabled, Task details are hidden under a twisty (expand/collapse) control in the output."
msgstr "Muda tu, maelezo ya kazi yanafichwa chini ya kitufe (kufungua/kusimamisha) katika matokeo."

msgid "Clicking this button will result in the following actions:  \n- The IP Address will be used to ping the Android device.  \n- The IP Address and port number will be used to query the Android device and get a list of available XML files found in the Tasker folder.  \n- The list of found XML files will be presented in a pulldown menu from which you can select the one you want to use.  \n- Once you have selected the XML file, it will be fetched and verified as valid XML which is then used as input to the program once you subsequently click on the 'Run' or 'ReRun' button.  \nThe listing is done by a small Task named 'MapTasker List Files v1', which MapTasker installs on your Android device the first time you use this button and then leaves there.  Nothing has to be imported by hand.  It requires the 'HTTP Server Example' project running on the device and Tasker 6.2 or higher -- the same requirements 'Save to Android' has -- and Tasker will ask you to authorize the connection the first time.  \nAllow a few seconds: installing the Task (once), running it and reading back its answer is not instant.  \n"
msgstr "Kubofya kitufe hiki, matendo التالية itafanywa:\n- Anwani ya IP itatumika kupiga Android.\n- Anwani ya IP na nambari ya port itatumika kuuliza kifaa cha Android na kupata orodha ya faili za XML zinazopo kwenye folda ya Tasker.\n- Orodha ya faili za XML zilizopatikana itoe kwenye orodha ambayo unaweza kuchagua moja unayotaka kutumia.\n- Baada ya kuchagua faili ya XML, itapatikana na kuthibitishwa kama faili ya XML thabiti, ambayo itatumika kama data kwa programu mara tu utobofya kitufe \"Fanya\" au \"Jaridishi\".\nOrodha hufanywa na programu ndogo inayoitwa \"MapTasker List Files v1\", ambayo MapTasker inashtaki kwenye kifaa chako cha Android mara ya kwanza unapoitumia kitufe hiki, na kisha huacha kwenye kifaa. Hakuna faili ambazo lazima zimepimwa. Inahitaji programu \"HTTP Server Example\" inayofanya kazi kwenye kifaa na Tasker 6.2 au zaidi – vigezo sawa na \"Save to Android\" – na Tasker itakuomba uruhusu muunganisho mara ya kwanza.\nPia, ni muhimu kutilia maan ya: kushtaki programu (mara moja), kuendesha na kupata majibu yake – hii si mchakato wa haraka.\n"

msgid "Display the 'Map', 'Diagram' or 'Tree' view of your configuration directly within the GUI.  \nXML must first be obtained from the either local drive or Android device for the views to work.  \nIf the XML has already been fetched, it will be used as input to the view.  Hitting the 'Clear' button will clear the view data.  \nVery large configurations will incur extended run times for Maps and Diagrams.  For best performance, select a single Project or Profile to map.  \nOptionally, limit the amount of data to be processed by using the 'View Limit' setting.  The larger the limit, the larger the output that will be allowed to be mapped.  The more output that is generated, the greater the processing time.  \n\nThe Diagram View has the following behavior:  \n - Only Projects and Profiles can be displayed. XML consisting of only a single Task or Scene will not be displayed.  \n - Click on a horizontal connector to highlight the entire connection in the diagram.  \n\nThe Tree View has the following behavior:  \n- Only Projects can be displayed. XML consisting of only a single Profile or Task or Scene will not be displayed.  \n- All Projects, Profiles, Tasks and Scenes are displayed regardless of the single name setting.  \n"
msgstr "Muonekano wa 'Ramani', 'Mchoro' au 'Mstari' wa usanidi wako lazima uonezwe moja kwa moja ndani ya GUI.\nXML lazima upate kutoka kwenye diski au kifaa cha Android ili muonekano uweze kufanya kazi.\nIkiwa XML tayari imepokelewa, itatumika kama input kwa muonekano. Kubofya kwenye kifungo \"Fanya Usanidi\" itaondoa data ya muonekano.\nUsanidi mkubwa sana utagharamia muda mrefu kwa Ramani na Mchororo. Kwa utendaji bora, chagua Mradi au Profaili moja pekee ili kuunda.\nKwa chaguo, pandua kiasi cha data inayochunguliwa kwa kutumia mipangilio \"Rangi\". Je, kiasi kikubwa, itaruhusiwa kuunda. Je, kiasi zaidi kinachoendelezwa, itahitajia muda mrefu zaidi.\n\nMuonekano wa Mchoro una hali ifuata:\n- Tu Mradi na Profaili inaweza kuonezwe. XML inayojumuisha tu kazi au mada moja haitazingatiwa.\n- Bonyeza kwenye kiunganishi gorizontal ili kuonyesha kiunganishi zima kwenye mchoro.\n\nMuonekano wa Mstari una hali ifuata:\n- Tu Mradi inaweza kuonezwe. XML inayojumuisha tu Profaili au Kazi au mada moja haitazingatiwa.\n- Mradi, Profaili, Kazi na Mada zote zinaonezwe, bila kujali mipangilio.\n"

msgid "MapTasker displays your Android Tasker configuration based on your uploaded Tasker XML file (e.g. 'backup.xml'). The display will optionally include all Projects, Profiles, Tasks and their actions, Profile/Task conditions and other Profile/Task related information.  \nOnce the XML file is loaded, you can optionally edit your Projects, Profiles, Tasks, and Scenes.  \n* Display options are:\n    Level 0: display first Task action only, for unnamed Tasks only (silent).\n    Level 1 = display all Task action details for unknown Tasks only (default).\n    Level 2 = display full Task action name on every Task.\n    Level 3 = display full Task action details on every Task with action details.\n    Level 4 = display level of 3 plus Project's global variables.\n    Level 5 = display level of 4 plus Scene argument details.  \n* Just Display Everything: Turns on the display of conditions, TaskerNet information, preferences, pretty output, directory, and configuration outline.  \n* Display Conditions: Turn on the display of Profile and Task conditions.  \n* Display TaskerNet Info - If available, display TaskerNet publishing information.  \n* Display Tasker Preferences - display Tasker's system Preferences.  \n* Hide Task Details under Twisty: hide Task information within ► and click to display.  \n* Display Directory of hyperlinks at beginning.  \n* Display Prettier Output: Make the output more human-readable by adding newlines and indentation for all arguments.  \n* Project/Profile/Task/Scene Names options to italicize, bold, underline and/or highlight their names.  \n* Task Action Limit: display a warning if the Task has more than the specified number of actions.  \n* Indentation amount for If/Then/Else Task Actions.  \n* Language: Select the language to be used for the output.  The default is English.  \n* Font To Use: Change the monospace font used for the output.  \n* View Limit: Control the amount of processing time used when generating the view.  \n* Notification Duration: How long a pop-up message stays on screen before it disappears.  'Until dismissed' keeps every message up until you close it.  \n* Dark Mode: Switch the GUI between light and dark appearance.  \n* Reset Options: Clear everything and start anew.  \n* Get Local XML File: fetch the backup/exported XML file from your local drive.  \n* Save Settings - Save these settings for later use.  \n* Restore Settings - Restore the settings from a previously saved session.  \n* Report Issue: Open the GitHub Issues page in your browser to report a problem or suggestion to the developer.  \n* Display Views: Display your configuration Map, Diagram, or Tree view of your Projects, Profiles, Tasks and Scenes directly in the GUI.  \n* Clear: Clear the Map/Diagram/Tree view data currently held and displayed.  \n* Health Check: Scan the loaded XML for broken references, unreferenced Tasks, Profiles and Scenes, and naming problems.  Click a finding to be taken to it in the Map.  \n* Compare Files: Compare another XML file against the loaded one to see what was added, removed, renamed and changed.  \n* Variable Xref: Trace every %variable in the loaded XML: where each one is set, where it is read, which are read but never set, which are set but never read, and which near-identical names are likely typos.  \n* Open View In New Window: Open each Map/Diagram request in its own new window/tab rather than reusing that view's existing one.  \n* Close Tabs On Exit: Have 'Exit' also close the main MapTasker window and any Map/Diagram windows/tabs it opened.  \n* Get XML from Android Device: fetch the backup/exported XML file from Android device.  You will be asked for the IP address and port number for your Android device, as well as the file location on the device.  \n   - List XML Files: List the XML files found on the Android device so you can select one rather than typing its location.\n   - Cancel Entry: Back out of the Android fetch process.  \n* Specific Name tab: enter a single, specific named item to display...\n   - Project Name: enter a specific Project to display.\n   - Profile Name: enter a specific Profile to display.\n   - Task Name: enter a specific Task to display.\n   - Scene Name: enter a specific Scene to display.  Its owning Project's heading and the\n                 Scene's elements (plus any Tasks those elements invoke) are displayed;\n                 the Project's Profiles and its other Scenes are not.\n   (These four are exclusive: enter one only)\n   - List Unnamed Items: Include unnamed Profiles and Tasks in the four pulldowns above.  \n   Add and Edit Projects, Profiles, Tasks and Scenes directly in the GUI, with various save options...\n   - Add Project/Profile/Task/Scene: Create a new object and add it to the loaded XML.\n   - Edit Project/Profile/Task/Scene: Modify the object currently selected in the pulldowns above.\n   - Rename: Give the object being edited a new name.\n   - Delete: Remove the object being edited from the loaded XML.\n   - Duplicate: Make a copy of the selected Scene element.\n   - Preview: Display the Scene being edited as it will appear.\n   - Save / Export: Write the object out to a standalone XML file of your choosing.\n   - Save To Current File: Write the entire configuration to a new, timestamped file beside the loaded one.\n   - Save To Android: Write the object back to your Android device.\n     (A safety copy of anything a save is about to overwrite is kept in the 'MapTasker_Backups' folder.)  \n   Editing commands...\n   - Undo: Back out the most recent Add/Edit/Delete/Rename change made to the loaded XML.  This changes what is loaded, not any file.\n   - Redo: Reapply the change most recently backed out by 'Undo'.\n   - Edit History: List every change made to the loaded XML this session, newest first.  \n* Colors tab: select colors for various elements of the display.\n              (e.g. color for Projects, Profiles, Tasks, etc.).\n   - Reset to Default Colors: Restore every color to its default value.  \n* Analyze tab: Run the analysis for a Project, Profile, Task or Scene against an Ai model.\n   - Show/Edit API Key(s): Enter or change the API keys used by the server-based AI models.\n   - Change Prompt: Modify the prompt sent to the AI model.\n   - Run Analysis: Submit the selected Project/Profile/Task and prompt to the selected model.\n   - Extended: List all available models rather than just the default set.  \n* Debug tab: Display Runtime Settings option and turn on Debug mode.  \n* Map/Diagram/Tree view toolbar commands are...\n   - Search: Highlight every instance of the case-insensitive text entered in the search box, up to the first 200.  Click a line number to go to that line.\n   - Find/Replace: (Map and Diagram only) Ask the loaded configuration a question rather than searching the text on screen: every Task performing a given action, every Profile a given trigger fires, everything naming a given app or Scene.  Click a result to be taken to it.\n   - Save Results: Save the 'Find/Replace' results to a text file.\n   - Top / Bottom: Jump to the beginning or the end of the displayed output.\n   - Toggle Wrap: Turn line wrapping on or off in the displayed output.\n   - Profiles Per Line: (Diagram only) The number of Profiles drawn side-by-side on a single line.  \n* Display Help: Display this help text.  \n* Get Android Help: Display the help for fetching the XML file from your Android device.  \n* '?' buttons: Display the help specific to the section in which the button appears.  \n* Exit: Exit the program (quit).  \nNotes:  \n- View the entire change log history at https://github.com/mctinker/Map-Tasker/blob/Master/Changelog.md  \n- Changing the appearance mode will change the colors used for the output to their default values.  \n"
msgstr "MapTasker inaonyesha usanidi wako wa Android Tasker kulingana na faili ya XML ya Tasker uliyopakia (p.m., 'backup.xml'). Maonyesho litakuwa la kusudi, na litajumuisha miradi, profaili, majukumu na vitendo zao, hali/majukumu na taarifa zingine zinazohusiana na profaili/majukumu.\nBaada ya faili ya XML kupakwa, unaweza kusasisha miradi, profaili, majukumu na picha zako.\n* Chaguzi za maonyesho:\n    Level 0: Onyesha tu hatua ya kwanza ya majukumu, kwa majukumu bila majina.\n    Level 1 = Onyesha maelezo yote ya hatua ya majukumu kwa majukumu bila majina (kiwango cha msingi).\n    Level 2 = Onyesha jina kamili la hatua ya majukumu kwa kila majukumu.\n    Level 3 = Onyesha maelezo kamili ya hatua ya majukumu kwa kila majukumu na maelezo ya hatua.\n    Level 4 = Onyesha kiwango cha 3 pamoja na mabadiliko ya mara kwa mara.\n    Level 5 = Onyesha kiwango cha 4 pamoja na maelezo ya mada.\n* Onyesha Yote: Washa maonyesho ya hali, taarifa za TaskerNet, mapendeleo, output nzuri, orodha, na muhtasari.\n* Onyesha Hali: Washa maonyesho ya hali za profaili na majukumu.\n* Onyesha Taarifa za TaskerNet - Ikiwa inapatikana,onyesha maelezo ya utengenezaji wa TaskerNet.\n* Onyesha Mapendeleo za Tasker - Onyesha mapendeleo za mfumo za Tasker.\n* Fanya Hifadhi ya Maelezo: Fanya hifadhi maelezo ndani ya ► na click ili kuonyesha.\n* Onyesha Orodha ya viungo kwenye mwisho.\n* Onyesha Output Nzuri: Fanya output kuwa rahisi zaidi kwa kuongeza barua na nafasi kwa ajili ya kila mambo.\n* Chaguzi za Majina: Piga rangi, bold, underline na/au ueleze majina.\n* Kiwango cha Majukumu: Onyesha tahariri ikiwa majukumu yana zaidi ya idadi iliyoainishwa.\n* Idadi inayotumika kwa If/Then/Else:\n* Lugha: Chagua lugha inayotumika kwa output. Kiwango cha msingi ni Kiingereza.\n* Font: Badilisha font inayotumika kwa output.\n* Kiwango cha Maonyesho: Udhibiti muda wa utumiaji wakati wa kuunda maonyesho.\n* Duration ya Notishi: Muda ambao ujumla unaoonekana kwenye skrini.\n* Mode Nyeusi: Badilisha GUI kati ya mwanga na giza.\n* Chaguzi za Utafutaji: Fanya usanifu na uanze upya.\n* Panda faili ya XML: Panda faili ya XML ya backup/iliyochapishwa kutoka kwenye kifaa chako.\n* Hifadhi: Hifadhi mapendeleo hizi kwa matumizi ya baadaye.\n* Upya: Upya mapendeleo kutoka kwenye dirisha lililoshinda.\n* Ripoti: Weka dirisha la GitHub Issues katika programu yako ili kuripoti tatizo au pendekezo kwa mtaalamu.\n* Onyesha: Onyesha usanidi wako, picha, au orodha ya miradi zako, profaili, majukumu na picha moja kwa moja kwenye GUI.\n* Fanya Safi: Fanya safi data ya picha/picha/orodha sasa kwenye maonyesho.\n* Tathmini: Scan faili ya XML iliyopakwa kwa majukumu, majukumu, profaili na picha ambazo hazipatikani, na masuala ya majina. Click kwenye mojawapo ili kupata kwenye picha.\n* Jumisha faili: Jumisha faili nyingine ya XML na iliyo pakwa ili kuona ni nini kilichoongezwa, kufutwa, kusakinishwa na badilishwa.\n* Variable Xref: Tumia kila %variable kwenye faili ya XML iliyopakwa: ambapo kila moja imewekwa, ambako inesomwa, ambazo zinaesomwa lakini hazijewekwa, ambazo zimewekwa lakini hazisomwa, na majina karibu sawa ambazo zinaweza kuwa miadi.\n* Fungua Maonyesho: Fungua kila ombi la picha/picha katika dirisha/tab mpya, badala ya kuutumia.\n* Fungua: Fungua dirisha kuu la MapTasker na dirisha/tab lolote la picha/picha ambalo lilifunguliwa.\n* Panda faili ya XML: Panda faili ya XML ya backup/iliyochapishwa kutoka kwenye kifaa cha Android. Utahudumiwa kwa anwani na nambari ya port ya kifaa chako cha Android, pamoja na eneo la faili kwenye kifaa.\n   - Orodha faili za XML: Orodha faili za XML zilizopo kwenye kifaa cha Android ili unaweza kuchagua moja badala ya kuandika eneo lake.\n   - Futa: Futa mchakato wa kifaa cha Android.\n* Dirisha la Jina Maalum: Ingiza item moja, iliyo maalum ili kuonyesha...\n- Jina la Mradi: ingiza Mradi maalum wa kuonyesha.\n   - Jina la Wasifu: ingiza Profaili maalum ili kuonyesha.\n   - Jina la Kazi: ingiza Kazi maalum ya kuonyesha.\n   - Jina la Onyesho: ingiza Onyesho maalum ili kuonyesha.  Umiliki wake wa kichwa cha Mradi na\n                 Vipengele vya Onyesho (pamoja na Majukumu yoyote ambayo vipengee hivyo vinaomba) vinaonyeshwa;\n                 Wasifu wa Mradi na Mandhari yake mengine sivyo.\n   (Hizi nne ni za kipekee: ingiza moja pekee)\n   - Orodhesha Vipengee Visivyotajwa: Jumuisha Wasifu na Majukumu ambayo hayajatajwa katika michoro nne zilizo hapo juu.  \n   Ongeza na Uhariri Miradi, Wasifu, Kazi na Matukio moja kwa moja kwenye GUI, na chaguo mbalimbali za kuhifadhi...\n   - Ongeza Mradi/Wasifu/Kazi/Onyesho: Unda kitu kipya na uiongeze kwenye XML iliyopakiwa.\n   - Hariri Mradi/Wasifu/Kazi/Maneno: Rekebisha kipengee kilichochaguliwa kwa sasa kwenye vibonzo vilivyo hapo juu.\n   - Badilisha jina: Kipe kitu kinachohaririwa jina jipya.\n   - Futa: Ondoa kitu kinachohaririwa kutoka kwa XML iliyopakiwa.\n   - Nakala: Tengeneza nakala ya kipengele kilichochaguliwa cha Onyesho.\n   - Hakiki: Onyesha Onyesho linalohaririwa jinsi litakavyoonekana.\n   - Hifadhi / Hamisha: Andika kitu kwa faili ya XML ya chaguo lako.\n   - Hifadhi kwa Faili ya Sasa: ​​Andika usanidi mzima kwa faili mpya, iliyowekwa alama kando ya iliyopakiwa.\n   - Hifadhi kwa Android: Andika kitu nyuma kwenye kifaa chako cha Android.\n     (Nakala ya usalama ya kitu chochote ambacho hifadhi inakaribia kubatizwa kinawekwa kwenye folda ya 'MapTasker_Backups'.)  \n   Inahariri amri...\n   - Tendua: Rudi nyuma mabadiliko ya hivi majuzi ya Ongeza/Hariri/Futa/Badilisha jina lililofanywa kwa XML iliyopakiwa.  Hii inabadilisha kile kilichopakiwa, sio faili yoyote.\n   - Rudia: Omba tena badiliko lililoungwa mkono hivi majuzi na 'Tendua'.\n   - Historia ya Kuhariri: Orodhesha kila mabadiliko yaliyofanywa kwa XML iliyopakiwa kipindi hiki, kipya zaidi kwanza.  \n* Kichupo cha rangi: chagua rangi kwa vipengele mbalimbali vya onyesho.\n              (k.m. rangi ya Miradi, Wasifu, Majukumu, n.k.).\n   - Weka Upya kwa Rangi Chaguomsingi: Rejesha kila rangi kwa thamani yake chaguomsingi.  \n* Kichupo cha Changanua: Fanya uchanganuzi wa Mradi, Wasifu, Kazi au Onyesho dhidi ya muundo wa Ai.\n   - Onyesha/Hariri Vifunguo vya API: Ingiza au ubadilishe vitufe vya API vinavyotumiwa na miundo ya AI inayotegemea seva.\n   - Mwongozo wa Badilisha: Rekebisha arifa iliyotumwa kwa muundo wa AI.\n   - Uchambuzi wa Uendeshaji: Wasilisha Mradi/Wasifu/Kazi uliyochagua na uulize kielelezo kilichochaguliwa.\n   - Iliyoongezwa: Orodhesha miundo yote inayopatikana badala ya seti chaguomsingi pekee.  \n* Kichupo cha utatuzi: Chaguo la Mipangilio ya Muda wa Kuendesha na uwashe hali ya Utatuzi.  \n* Amri za upau wa vidhibiti vya Ramani/Mchoro/Mti ni...\n   - Utafutaji: Angazia kila tukio la maandishi yasiyojali kadhia yaliyowekwa kwenye kisanduku cha kutafutia, hadi yale 200 ya kwanza. Bofya nambari ya mstari ili kwenda kwenye mstari huo.\n   - Tafuta/Ubadilishe: (Ramani na Mchoro pekee) Uliza usanidi uliopakiwa swali badala ya kutafuta maandishi kwenye skrini: kila Jukumu linalotekeleza kitendo fulani, kila Wasifu kwa kichochezi fulani, kila kitu kinachotaja programu au Onyesho fulani.  Bofya matokeo ili kupelekwa kwake.\n   - Hifadhi Matokeo: Hifadhi matokeo ya 'Tafuta/Badilisha' kwenye faili ya maandishi.\n   - Juu / Chini: Rukia mwanzo au mwisho wa matokeo yaliyoonyeshwa.\n   - Geuza Ufungaji: Washa au uzime ufungaji wa mstari katika matokeo yanayoonyeshwa.\n   - Profaili Kwa Kila Mstari: (Mchoro pekee) Idadi ya Wasifu iliyochorwa kando kwa mstari mmoja.  \n* Usaidizi wa Kuonyesha: Onyesha maandishi haya ya usaidizi.  \n* Pata Usaidizi wa Android: Onyesha usaidizi wa kuleta faili ya XML kutoka kwa kifaa chako cha Android.  \n* '?' vifungo: Onyesha usaidizi maalum kwa sehemu ambayo kifungo kinaonekana.  \n* Toka: Toka kwenye programu (acha).  \nVidokezo:  \n- Tazama historia nzima ya kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko katika https://github.com/mctinker/Map-Tasker/blob/Master/Changelog.md  \n- Kubadilisha hali ya mwonekano kutabadilisha rangi zinazotumiwa kwa matokeo kuwa thamani zao chaguomsingi.\n"

msgid "The 'View Limit' is a means to control the amount of processing time used when generating the view.  \n- The numbers represent the relative amount of output lines to be generated.  \n- The larger the limit, the larger the output that will be allowed to be mapped.  The more output that is generated, the greater the processing time.  \n- Very large configurations will generate very large output maps and will cause greater processing time.  On older devices, this can take up to 30 seconds or more.  \n- By setting a limit, you can control the processing time used when mapping a configuration by not allowing longer durations.  \n- If the limit is hit when calculating the map, the output will stop there.  \n- You can experiment with this setting to see which setting is best for your use case.  \n- Selecting a single Project, Profile or Task is another means to limit the processing time.  \n"
msgstr "'Kikomo cha Kutazama' ni njia ya kudhibiti muda wa uchakataji unaotumika wakati wa kutoa mwonekano.  \n- Nambari zinawakilisha kiasi kijacho cha mistari ya kutoa itakayotolewa.  \n- Kadiri kikomo kinavyokuwa kikubwa, ndivyo matokeo yatakayoruhusiwa kuchorwa yatakavyokuwa makubwa.  Kadiri pato linavyotolewa, ndivyo muda wa usindikaji unavyoongezeka.  \n- Mipangilio mikubwa sana itazalisha ramani kubwa sana za matokeo na itasababisha muda zaidi wa uchakataji.  Kwenye vifaa vya zamani, hii inaweza kuchukua hadi sekunde 30 au zaidi.  \n- Kwa kuweka kikomo, unaweza kudhibiti muda wa kuchakata unaotumiwa wakati wa kupanga usanidi kwa kutoruhusu muda mrefu zaidi.  \n- Ikiwa kikomo kinapigwa wakati wa kuhesabu ramani, matokeo yatakoma hapo.  \n- Unaweza kufanya majaribio na mpangilio huu ili kuona ni mpangilio gani unaofaa kwa hali yako ya utumiaji.  \n- Kuchagua Mradi mmoja, Wasifu au Kazi ni njia nyingine ya kupunguza muda wa usindikaji.\n"

msgid "The Analyze tab is used to run the Ai analysis on your Profile, using either the local llama model or the server-based Open AI, Claude or DeepSeek models.  \nThe following steps are required in order to run AI against your Profile.  \n1- If using a server-based AI, you must have a valid API key from the provider (e.g. OpenAI).  You can use the 'Show/Edit API Key(s)' button to enter your key(s).  \n2- The default prompt is: 'suggest improvements in performance and readibility: (your project/profile/task)', and is automatically preceded by: 'Given the following (Project/Profile/Task) in Tasker, '.  If modifying the prompt, you are only modifing the 'suggest improvements...' portion.  \n3- Select the model you want to use.  \n   o The model selected will determine with which AI the analysis is to be performed.  \n4- Click the 'Run Analysis' button.  It will turn green when all of the necessary data has been entered.  \n   o If you have not yet selected a model, prompt or single Project, Profile or Task, or valid API key, then you will be prompted to do so first.  \n   o The process may take some time and runs in the background.  The results will appear in a separate window.  \n   o Local models not yet loaded onto your computer will be loaded in the background once the analysis begins.  \nYour designated api-keys (if any), model, selected Project, Profile or Task and Ai prompt will all be saved across sessions.  \nThe 'Rerun' feature will be used under-the-covers to display the results of the analysis in a new window.  \n"
msgstr "Kichupo cha Kuchanganua kinatumika kuendesha uchanganuzi wa Ai kwenye Wasifu wako, kwa kutumia modeli ya karibu ya llama au miundo ya Open AI, Claude au DeepSeek inayotokana na seva.  \nHatua zifuatazo zinahitajika ili kuendesha AI dhidi ya Wasifu wako.  \n1- Iwapo unatumia AI inayotegemea seva, lazima uwe na ufunguo halali wa API kutoka kwa mtoa huduma (k.m. OpenAI).  Unaweza kutumia kitufe cha 'Onyesha/Hariri Vifunguo vya API' kuweka funguo zako.  \n2- Kidokezo chaguo-msingi ni: 'pendekeza uboreshaji katika utendaji na urahisishaji: (mradi/wasifu/kazi yako)', na hutanguliwa kiotomatiki na: 'Kutokana na yafuatayo (Mradi/Wasifu/Task) katika Tasker,'.  Ukirekebisha kidokezo, unabadilisha tu sehemu ya 'pendekeza uboreshaji...'.  \n3- Chagua mtindo unaotaka kutumia.  \n   o Mfano uliochaguliwa utaamua ni AI gani uchanganuzi utafanywa.  \n4- Bonyeza kitufe cha 'Run Analysis'.  Itageuka kijani wakati data zote muhimu zimeingizwa.  \n   o Ikiwa bado haujachagua modeli, haraka au Mradi mmoja, Wasifu au Kazi, au ufunguo halali wa API, basi utaombwa kufanya hivyo kwanza.  \n   o Mchakato unaweza kuchukua muda na unaendelea chinichini.  Matokeo yataonekana kwenye dirisha tofauti.  \n   o Miundo ya ndani ambayo bado haijapakiwa kwenye kompyuta yako itapakiwa chinichini mara uchanganuzi utakapoanza.  \nVifunguo vyako vya api (ikiwa vipo), modeli, Mradi uliochaguliwa, Wasifu au Task na kidokezo cha Ai zote zitahifadhiwa katika vipindi vyote.  \nKipengele cha 'Rudia' kitatumika chini ya vifuniko ili kuonyesha matokeo ya uchanganuzi katika dirisha jipya.\n"

msgid "The following steps are required in order to fetch a Tasker XML file directly from your Android device.  \n1- Both this device and the Android device must be on the same named network.  \n2- The Tasker Project 'HTTP Server Example' or identical function must be installed and active on the Android device (the server must be running):  \n    https://tinyurl.com/4p5cz8sv  \nThat is the only setup required.  The 'List XML Files' option used to need a second, separate profile ('MapTasker List') imported from TaskerNet and left enabled; it no longer does.  MapTasker now installs a small Task named 'MapTasker List Files v1' on the device to do the listing, the same way 'App not listed?' installs one to fetch your applications.  \nYou will be asked for the IP address, the port number for your Android device, as well as the file location on the Android device.  Default values are supplied, where...  \n'192.168.0.210' is the default IP address,  \n'1821' is the default port number for the Tasker HTTP Server Example running on your Android device  \n'/Tasker/configs/user/backup.xml' is the default file location.  If you don't know the file location and have already entered your IP address and port, then you can select the 'List XML Files' button to get a list of available XML files on your Android device for selection.  \nUsage Notes:  \nThe IP address and port can be obtained by installing the 'HTTP Server Example' project from the above URL on your Android device. Then run the task named 'Update GD HTTP Info' to get the Android notification:  \nHTTP Server Info\nServer info updated {\"device name\":\"http://192.168.0.49:1821\"}  \n- To fetch the XML file, click on the button  \n 'Get XML from Android Device'  \nThen modify the default values presented in the input fields below this button, and then click on the button 'Enter and Click Here to Set XML Details' or 'List XML Files'.  \n- Hitting either button will ping the Android device to see if it is available.  The ping will timeout after 10 seconds if the device is not reachable.  Make sure that the IP address is correct.  \nClick on the 'Cancel Entry' button to back out of this fetch process.  \n"
msgstr "Hatua zifuatazo zinahitajika ili kuleta faili ya Tasker XML moja kwa moja kutoka kwa kifaa chako cha Android.  \n1- Kifaa hiki na kifaa cha Android lazima ziwe kwenye mtandao uliopewa jina moja.  \n2- Mradi wa Tasker 'Mfano wa Seva ya HTTP' au utendakazi unaofanana lazima usakinishwe na kufanya kazi kwenye kifaa cha Android (lazima seva iwe inaendesha):  \n    https://tinyurl.com/4p5cz8sv  \nHuo ndio usanidi pekee unaohitajika.  Chaguo la 'Orodha Faili za XML' linalotumika kuhitaji wasifu wa pili, tofauti ('Orodha ya Ramani ya Tasker') iliyoingizwa kutoka TaskerNet na kushoto kuwezeshwa; haifanyi tena.  MapTasker sasa inasakinisha Jukumu dogo linaloitwa 'MapTasker List Files v1' kwenye kifaa ili kuorodhesha, kwa njia ile ile ya 'Programu haijaorodheshwa?' inasakinisha moja ili kuleta programu zako.  \nUtaulizwa anwani ya IP, nambari ya bandari ya kifaa chako cha Android, pamoja na eneo la faili kwenye kifaa cha Android.  Thamani chaguomsingi hutolewa, ambapo...  \n'192.168.0.210' ndiyo anwani chaguo-msingi ya IP,  \n'1821' ndiyo nambari ya poti chaguo-msingi ya Mfano wa Seva ya Tasker HTTP inayoendeshwa kwenye kifaa chako cha Android  \n'/Tasker/configs/user/backup.xml' ndilo eneo chaguomsingi la faili.  Ikiwa hujui eneo la faili na tayari umeweka anwani yako ya IP na mlango, basi unaweza kuchagua kitufe cha 'Orodhesha Faili za XML' ili kupata orodha ya faili za XML zinazopatikana kwenye kifaa chako cha Android kwa ajili ya uteuzi.  \nVidokezo vya Matumizi:  \nAnwani ya IP na mlango unaweza kupatikana kwa kusakinisha mradi wa 'Mfano wa Seva ya HTTP' kutoka kwa URL iliyo hapo juu kwenye kifaa chako cha Android. Kisha endesha kazi inayoitwa 'Sasisha Maelezo ya GD HTTP' ili kupata arifa ya Android:  \nMaelezo ya Seva ya HTTP\nMaelezo ya seva yamesasishwa {\"jina la kifaa\":\"http://192.168.0.49:1821\"}  \n- Ili kuchukua faili ya XML, bonyeza kitufe  \n 'Pata XML kutoka kwa Kifaa cha Android'  \nKisha rekebisha maadili chaguo-msingi yaliyowasilishwa katika sehemu za ingizo chini ya kitufe hiki, na kisha ubofye kitufe cha 'Ingiza na Bofya Hapa Ili Kuweka Maelezo ya XML' au 'Orodhesha Faili za XML'.  \n- Kupiga kitufe chochote kutapiga kifaa cha Android ili kuona ikiwa kinapatikana.  Ping itaisha baada ya sekunde 10 ikiwa kifaa hakipatikani.  Hakikisha kwamba anwani ya IP ni sahihi.  \nBofya kwenye kitufe cha 'Ghairi Ingizo' ili kurudi nje ya mchakato huu wa kuleta.\n"

msgid "This menu is where you define your AI API keys for use by the AI 'Analyze' button.  \nThe keys are saved across sessions.  \nThe keys are used to access the OpenAI, Claude AI, Gemini AI, and DeepSeek AI server-based models.  \nClick on the 'Clear' button to clear a specific API key entry.  \nSelect 'Ok' to save the changes or 'Cancel' to back out of the changes.  \n"
msgstr "Menyu hii ndipo unapofafanua funguo zako za AI API kwa ajili ya matumizi ya kitufe cha AI cha 'Changanua'.  \nVifunguo huhifadhiwa katika vipindi vyote.  \nVifunguo hutumika kufikia mifano ya seva ya OpenAI, Claude AI, Gemini AI, na DeepSeek AI.  \nBofya kwenye kitufe cha 'Futa' ili kufuta ingizo maalum la ufunguo wa API.  \nChagua 'Sawa' ili kuhifadhi mabadiliko au 'Ghairi' ili uondoe mabadiliko.\n"

msgid "A Legacy Scene has a pixel canvas and a list of UI elements. It is the original Scene format, and is what Tasker itself produces."
msgstr "A Legacy Scene ina msingi wa pexeli na orodha ya vipengele za kiolesani. Ni format ya asili, na ndiyo ambayo Tasker hutengeneza."

msgid "Displays the Diagram view.\n\nUse this to visualize the relationships between your Projects, Profiles, Tasks, and Scenes."
msgstr "Hifadhi maoni ya mchoro.\n\nTumia hii ili kuona mahusiano kati ya miradi, majina, majukumu, na mazingira zako."

msgid "Displays the Map view.\n\nUse this to display the Tasker configuration of your Projects, Profiles, Tasks, and Scenes."
msgstr "Hifadhi maoni ya ramani.\n\nTumia hii ili kuonyesha usanidi wa \"Tasker\" wa miradi, profaili, majukumu na eneo lako."

msgid "Displays the Tree view.\n\nUse this to navigate the hierarchical structure of your Projects, Profiles, Tasks, and Scenes."
msgstr "Hifadhi maonyesho ya \"Mbinu\".\n\nTumia hii ili kukaa katika muundo wa mraba wa mradi, majina, majukumu na madhara."

msgid "Exports the Task as XML to a file on your computer."
msgstr "Hifadhi kazi kama faili ya XML kwenye kompyuta yako."

msgid "Saves this Profile, with all of its conditions and linked Tasks, as one standalone .prf.xml file -- the same format Tasker's own Profile export produces.\n\nTasks the Profile runs are not included; they belong to their own Project."
msgstr "Hifadhi Maelezo hii, pamoja na masharti zake na majukumu iliyohusishwa, kama faili moja ya .prf.xml – ambayo ni format sawa na iliyoendelezwa na Tasker.\n\nMajukumu ambayo Maelezo huendesha hayo hayo, na yanaendelezwa katika Mradi wake."

msgid "Select a specific Profile to target for display or editing."
msgstr "Chagua profaili maalum ambayo utaweza kutumia kwa ajili ya kuonyesha au kuhariri."

msgid "Select a specific Project to target for display or editing."
msgstr "Chagua mradi maalum ambao utazingatia ili kuonyesha au kuhariri."

msgid "Select a specific Scene to target for display or editing."
msgstr "Chagua picha maalum ambayo utaweza kuonyesha au kuhariri."

msgid "Select a specific Task to target for display or editing."
msgstr "Chagua kazi maalum ambayo utaangalia au kuhariri."

msgid "Select this to include Profiles and Tasks that do not have a name in the list."
msgstr "Chagua hii ili kujumuisha Majina na Majukumu ambazo hazina majina kwenye orodha."
